# KOF: Maximum Impact - Maniax (534E0007): RETURNING route. It needs the
# title's option data on the disk, which the Thor has had since 2026-09-27
# 14:23 PDT. PLAYED by nav.py on the Thor, 2026-09-27 14:24 PDT
# (lane.titleroutes HELD session kof-mi.returning-20260927T142411).
#
#   the intro video (START ends it) -> "OPTION DATA ALREADY EXISTS ON THE
#   XBOX HARD DISK. LOAD OPTION DATA?", cursor on YES (A) -> the OK box (A)
#   -> a START button on black (START) -> MAIN MENU, cursor on STORY (A) ->
#   CHARACTER SELECT, 1P on Alba Meira (A, A, A) -> load -> the opponent's
#   entrance -> round 1 against Soiree Meira, timer and both health bars.
#
# On a disk without the option data the first box is "OPTION DATA CANNOT BE
# FOUND. CREATE NEW OPTION DATA?" (YES saves it; NO asks "BEGIN GAME PLAY
# ANYWAY?" with the cursor on NO). This route's first A then answers YES and
# creates the data, and the boxes after it differ by one, so the run is
# not this route. No first-run route was recorded: in that session the hat
# moved the cursor on one box and not on the next.
#
# Player control: in the play pattern Alba walks in and kicks Soiree, whose
# health bar drops (nav frames 008-round -> 011-played; the timer runs 58 ->
# 53). The mark is 10 s into round 1. 30-33 fps in the fight.
#
# NOT yet replayed.
